# Case C, violating. vC1: the cited source is taken as the target; the only anchor is on the Constitution, the bill article the comment is about has none.
@prefix del:  <https://w3id.org/deliberation/ontology#> .
@prefix px:   <urn:del:proposed#> .
@prefix ex:   <urn:del:hard-cases:> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
